poster('summer','#d59b79','#563d55','#f4cf9d','CÓ NHỮNG MÙA HÈ KHÔNG BAO GIỜ QUA',['CHẠM VÀO','MÙA HẠ'],'<circle cx="380" cy="270" r="110" fill="#efc294"/><path d="M0 370Q200 325 600 390V620H0" fill="#788f98"/><path d="M0 450Q250 390 600 440M0 480Q300 430 600 490M0 520Q240 480 600 525" fill="none" stroke="#dbc5ae" stroke-width="3" opacity=".5"/><path d="M0 585Q230 480 600 560V660H0Z" fill="#c3aa94"/><path d="M235 488V550M260 478V540" stroke="#4f4353" stroke-width="12"/><circle cx="235" cy="472" r="11" fill="#4f4353"/><circle cx="260" cy="463" r="11" fill="#4f4353"/>')
poster('race','#26414b','#111d28','#ea7a50','MỖI KHÚC CUA. MỘT GIỚI HẠN MỚI.',['ĐƯỜNG ĐUA','VÔ TẬN'],'<path d="M0 590L600 220M0 680L600 310" stroke="#c46c4a" stroke-width="5" opacity=".6"/><path d="M0 650L600 280" stroke="#96b0ae" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="40 25"/><g transform="translate(120 360) rotate(-28)"><path d="M0 70L60 30H220L290 65L315 100H0Z" fill="#e57650"/><path d="M90 36L70 65H240L205 36Z" fill="#132b3a"/><circle cx="70" cy="105" r="28" fill="#0e1620"/><circle cx="245" cy="105" r="28" fill="#0e1620"/><circle cx="70" cy="105" r="13" fill="#7e8c8e"/><circle cx="245" cy="105" r="13" fill="#7e8c8e"/></g>')
poster('planet','#164952','#061b30','#a6d7c6','LẮNG NGHE HƠI THỞ CỦA ĐẠI DƯƠNG',['HÀNH TINH','XANH'],'<circle cx="310" cy="300" r="160" fill="#153e54" stroke="#81baad" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M200 200Q310 150 390 220L350 300L240 340L200 290Z" fill="#6b9f86" opacity=".7"/><path d="M360 335L420 350L380 425L330 400Z" fill="#739c89"/><path d="M20 510Q300 440 580 510" fill="none" stroke="#93c3bc" stroke-width="2" opacity=".5"/>')
poster('stars','#252d58','#11152b','#d8bc87','NGƯỚC NHÌN LÊN. PHÉP MÀU VẪN Ở ĐÓ.',['NGƯỜI GIỮ','NHỮNG VÌ SAO'],'<path d="M300 140L322 220L405 240L325 266L300 350L276 267L196 240L278 219Z" fill="#e2c58e"/><circle cx="300" cy="240" r="160" fill="none" stroke="#d5c18d" opacity=".2"/><path d="M0 590L170 420L300 510L460 380L600 560V650H0Z" fill="#111a31"/><path d="M292 500V570M310 500V570" stroke="#a39da6" stroke-width="9"/><circle cx="300" cy="472" r="14" fill="#b4a9a5"/><path d="M283 485H317L326 535H275Z" fill="#a699a1"/>')
hero_stars=''.join(f'<circle cx="{random.randrange(1600)}" cy="{random.randrange(700)}" r="{random.uniform(.3,1.3):.2f}" fill="#f6e7c9" opacity="{random.uniform(.1,.7):.2f}"/>' for _ in range(330))
hero=f'''<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1600" height="700" viewBox="0 0 1600 700"><defs><linearGradient id="sky" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#090f20"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="#1b2331"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#342d2e"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="halo"><stop stop-color="#e9c28c" stop-opacity=".6"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#b99b7430"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c49f6d" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><radialGradient id="planet" cx=".82" cy=".15"><stop stop-color="#b5a083"/><stop offset=".2" stop-color="#6e655d"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#202635"/><stop offset=".9" stop-color="#090e1b"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="rim" x2=".2" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#f0d6a6"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="#8c785e" stop-opacity=".4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#826c55" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="ground" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#79715f"/><stop offset=".1" stop-color="#373b3d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0a0f1c"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="1600" height="700" fill="url(#sky)"/>{hero_stars}<ellipse cx="1110" cy="285" rx="520" ry="390" fill="url(#halo)"/><g transform="rotate(-25 1140 300)"><ellipse cx="1140" cy="300" rx="406" ry="95" fill="none" stroke="#ddc599" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".6"/><ellipse cx="1140" cy="300" rx="435" ry="105" fill="none" stroke="#baa17b" stroke-width="12" opacity=".17"/><ellipse cx="1140" cy="300" rx="454" ry="112" fill="none" stroke="#b6a084" stroke-width="1" opacity=".23"/></g><circle cx="1140" cy="290" r="227" fill="url(#planet)"/><circle cx="1140" cy="290" r="227" fill="none" stroke="url(#rim)" stroke-width="2.5"/><path d="M0 637Q200 610 420 620L620 585L810 598L930 560L1060 573L1200 538L1330 564L1475 525L1600 540V700H0Z" fill="url(#ground)"/><path d="M900 620L1040 594L1200 615M1180 646L1440 587L1590 604M700 677L990 642L1240 659" fill="none" stroke="#99917b" stroke-width="1" opacity=".13"/><g transform="translate(1172 520)"><rect x="-18" y="10" width="36" height="48" rx="7" fill="#b5ad99"/><rect x="-23" y="17" width="8" height="31" rx="3" fill="#656962"/><circle cy="0" r="15" fill="#c8c1ad"/><path d="M-10 -5Q0 -14 10 -5V6H-10Z" fill="#242d35"/><path d="M-9 55L-12 88M9 55L12 88M-19 20L-28 48M19 20L27 45" stroke="#a6a592" stroke-width="10"/><path d="M-15 88H-5M6 88H17" stroke="#656a64" stroke-width="6"/><path d="M-6 21H7V34H-6Z" fill="#555f61"/><path d="M15 16Q80 30 94 12" fill="none" stroke="#a18b6a" stroke-width="2"/></g></svg>'''
(out/'hero.svg').write_text(hero,encoding='utf-8')
(out/'vega.svg').write_text('<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="14" fill="#0b1020"/><path d="M12 15H24L33 43L45 15H57L36 52H25Z" fill="#e63946"/></svg>',encoding='utf-8')
